    <system:String x:Key="AboutTitle">About GothicSaveEditor Redux</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="AboutDescription">Modern, high-performance savegame editor for Gothic 1, Gothic 2 (NotR), and large mods such as Odyssee (.NET 10).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="AboutFeatures">• Structured BinSafe parser (thread-safe, no array or overflow bugs)&#x0a;• Atomic saving with SHA-256 integrity verification&#x0a;• Automatic folder backups with rotation in %LOCALAPPDATA%&#x0a;• Responsive search &amp; UI virtualization even with 100,000+ variables</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="AboutCredits">Based on the original GothicSaveEditor fork by Flycrafting (originally created by RightMAN).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="AboutClose">Close</system:String>
    
